    "CLS": "EMS/contract manufacturer building Broadcom/OpenAI custom AI ASICs (Jalapeno) + AI server hardware | strengthening",
    "DRAM": "Thematic memory ETF -- holds the exact names CXMT now competes with (Samsung, SK Hynix, Micron) | watch",
    "VRT": "Thermal/power management (cooling, UPS) for AI datacenters | strengthening",
    "AVGO": "Custom AI ASICs (XPUs) and networking silicon for hyperscalers | strengthening",
    "MRVL": "Custom AI silicon and optical interconnect for hyperscalers | watch",
    "EWY": "South Korea ETF: >50% Samsung + SK Hynix. On 2026-07-28 Samsung fell 14.4% (worst since Oct 2008) and SK Hynix 14.7%; KOSPI -10.84%, -34% in 25 days after a 300% spike | watch",
    "CIEN": "Optical networking gear for AI datacenter/telco backbone -- trimmed 59%, weak FY guide vs AI PoC win | watch",
    "QCOM": "Diversifying from handsets into AI/datacenter CPUs and auto | strengthening",
